Subject: [PATCH 066/191] [ae-patch] Let extension pages open the Azure and
 Fabric capacity links Fabric Admin shows

Fabric Admin asks the host to open a capacity's Azure portal overview and Fabric's capacity settings page, and navigation.openExternal refused both because only host-issued URLs and GitHub pull request or issue links were allowed. isAeFabricAdminLinkUrl admits exactly those two shapes (strict guid, Azure name characters, https, no userinfo, port, query or extra path).
